  "description": "EJESIY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H100 Ho4 N12 O16 S6. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.552-3.847 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.27-112.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H100Ho4N12O16S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
